  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging Model Renewable Energy Penetration in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Energy (biogas).Beneficiaries: 130 .Project Description: The TAHUDE Expansion Grant is intended to expand and roll out a more robust bio-gas production project using animal waste from cattle kept by rural communities in Arusha, Manyara and Kilimanjaro Regions. The bio-gas is used by rural households for cooking.</narrative>
  </description>
